== Overview ==


Hacked Juggernaut Titan is [[Ultimate]] [[Units|Unit]] that was added on 05/04/25. 

== Obtainment ==
You can obtain this from buying the Hacked Juggernaut Titan plush on [https://telanthric.shop/?srsltid=AfmBOopKeJvzforkl5YAP7mVmKKvpHH678xcSBePGuhp5flpN2gmK39I Telanthric.shop]. you will also be able to get it from [[Trading]], buying from the [[Marketplace]], or getting gifted it in the [[Post Office]].

