== Trivia ==

* This is the first Astro Toilet [[Units|unit]].
** It is also the first [[Ultimate]] [[Units|Unit]] to be a toilet.
* This unit was been released in [[Partner Experiments]] early, just like the [[Telanthric Titan]].
* This unit was buffed from 230K DPS to 250K DPS, which is the same DPS as [[Sinister Titan Clockman]] and [[Quantum Cameraman]].
* The cooldown on Hacked Juggernaut's Supercharged Mode is confirmed to be 300 seconds by pool.
* [[Hacked Juggernaut Titan]] is the third [[Ultimate]] to deal 250K DPS, second being [[Sinister Titan Clockman]], and first being [[Quantum Cameraman]].
* His Aoe cone doesn't work at all.

